# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Enquiry form integration (server-only — never NEXT_PUBLIC_*)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Both values are read only inside src/app/api/enquiry/route.ts, which runs
# on the server. They are never bundled into the browser.
#
# Setup instructions: docs/enquiry-integration.md

# The Apps Script web-app deployment URL (ends in /exec).
ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# A long random string. Must match the SHARED_SECRET script property set on
# the Apps Script side. Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
